        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 7301KA2, Grade 2 Single Cylinder Residential Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by DoralLock, the 7301KA2 single cylinder deadbolt is rated as an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security lock. The single cylinder function means that there is a keyed lock on the exterior and a thumbturn on the interior. Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\".  It installs easily in most pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching  \r\n<a href=\"/products/grade-2-double-cylinder-deadbolt-dorallock-7312ka2\"><b>DoralLock 7312KA2 Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the DoralLock Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 Security</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for both standard 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li>5 pin cylinder locks (Kwikset Compatible Keyway).</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Fit standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Full 1\" bolt throw.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li><b>3 Year Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>1 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-7301KA2-specifications.pdf?v=1704262176\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock 7301KA2 Single Cylinder Residential Deadbolt Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
