                "title": "Single Cylinder Grade 2 Deadbolt, DOR-7301KA2",
                "description": "DoralLock 7301KA2, Grade 2 Single Cylinder Residential Deadbolt - Made by DoralLock, the 7301KA2 single cylinder deadbolt is rated as an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security lock. The single cylinder function means that there is a keyed lock on the exterior and a thumbturn on the interior. Adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches.  It installs easily in most pre-drilled doors.",
